{"seq":2,"slug":"runtime-agnostic-design","title":"运行时无关设计：编写可移植的异步库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/advanced/runtime-agnostic-design","wordCount":852,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"运行时无关设计-编写可移植的异步库\">运行时无关设计：编写可移植的异步库</h1><p>Rust 异步生态存在多个运行时——Tokio、async-std、smol、embassy（嵌入式）——它们各有适用场景。如果你编写的是<strong>库</strong>（而非应用程序），将代码绑定到特定运行时会人为地限制使用者的选择，甚至在同一进程中使用两个不同运行时时导致冲突。运行时无关设计（Runtime-Agnostic Design）是 Rust 异步库的重要实践原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>运行时无关的核心是&quot;使用标准 trait，不用运行时专属 API&quot;。<code>futures</code> crate 提供了 <code>AsyncRead</code>、<code>AsyncWrite</code>、<code>Stream</code>、<code>Sink</code> 等运行时无关的 IO trait；通过 Cargo feature flags 实现多运行时支持；对于确实需要 spawn/sleep 的场景，将运行时操作作为参数注入（依赖注入模式）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Library[异步库] --&gt;|使用| FuturesTrait[futures::AsyncRead AsyncWrite Stream]&#10;    Library --&gt;|特性门控| TokioImpl[tokio feature - Tokio 实现]&#10;    Library --&gt;|特性门控| StdImpl[async-std feature - async-std 实现]&#10;    Library --&gt;|依赖注入| SpawnFn[spawn: impl Fn Future]&#10;    App1[Tokio 应用] --&gt;|feature = tokio| Library&#10;    App2[async-std 应用] --&gt;|feature = async-std| Library\">graph TD\n    Library[异步库] --&gt;|使用| FuturesTrait[futures::AsyncRead AsyncWrite Stream]\n    Library --&gt;|特性门控| TokioImpl[tokio feature - Tokio 实现]\n    Library --&gt;|特性门控| StdImpl[async-std feature - async-std 实现]\n    Library --&gt;|依赖注入| SpawnFn[spawn: impl Fn Future]\n    App1[Tokio 应用] --&gt;|feature = tokio| Library\n    App2[async-std 应用] --&gt;|feature = async-std| Library</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>应避免（库代码）</th>\n<th>应替换为</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>tokio::spawn(f)</code></td>\n<td>接受 <code>spawn: impl Fn</code> 参数</td>\n<td>绑定运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tokio::time::sleep(d)</code></td>\n<td>接受 <code>sleep: impl Fn</code> 参数</td>\n<td>绑定运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tokio::net::TcpStream</code></td>\n<td><code>impl AsyncRead + AsyncWrite</code></td>\n<td>绑定运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tokio::sync::Mutex</code></td>\n<td><code>futures::lock::Mutex</code></td>\n<td>绑定运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>#[tokio::test]</code></td>\n<td><code>futures::executor::block_on</code></td>\n<td>测试也可无关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"运行时无关设计的层次\">运行时无关设计的层次</h2><p>并非所有代码都需要运行时无关，这取决于代码的抽象层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>运行时耦合程度</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>应用层</strong></td>\n<td>可以选择特定运行时</td>\n<td>服务端应用选择 Tokio</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>框架层</strong></td>\n<td>应提供运行时选择</td>\n<td>Axum（基于 Tokio）vs Actix（自有运行时）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>通用库层</strong></td>\n<td>应尽量避免运行时耦合</td>\n<td><code>serde</code>、<code>sqlx</code>（支持多运行时）、<code>hyper</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>协议/算法层</strong></td>\n<td>完全运行时无关</td>\n<td><code>http</code> crate、<code>rustls</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"避免运行时耦合的实践\">避免运行时耦合的实践</h2><h3 id=\"不要直接-spawn\">不要直接 spawn</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 耦合到 Tokio 的写法（库代码中避免）&#10;pub async fn process(data: Vec&lt;Item&gt;) -&gt; Vec&lt;Output&gt; {&#10;    let handles: Vec&lt;_&gt; = data.into_iter()&#10;        .map(|item| tokio::spawn(process_item(item)))  // Tokio 专属！&#10;        .collect();&#10;&#10;    futures::future::join_all(handles).await&#10;        .into_iter()&#10;        .filter_map(|r| r.ok())&#10;        .collect()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 运行时无关的写法：让调用方控制并发&#10;pub async fn process(data: Vec&lt;Item&gt;) -&gt; Vec&lt;Output&gt; {&#10;    // 使用 FuturesUnordered，不假设 spawn 能力&#10;    use futures::stream::{FuturesUnordered, StreamExt};&#10;&#10;    let futures: FuturesUnordered&lt;_&gt; = data.into_iter()&#10;        .map(process_item)&#10;        .collect();&#10;&#10;    futures.collect().await&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 耦合到 Tokio 的写法（库代码中避免）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn process(data: Vec&#x3C;Item>) -> Vec&#x3C;Output> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let handles: Vec&#x3C;_> = data.into_iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|item| tokio::spawn(process_item(item)))  // Tokio 专属！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    futures::future::join_all(handles).await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .into_iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter_map(|r| r.ok())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .collect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 运行时无关的写法：让调用方控制并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn process(data: Vec&#x3C;Item>) -> Vec&#x3C;Output> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 使用 FuturesUnordered，不假设 spawn 能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use futures::stream::{FuturesUnordered, StreamExt};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let futures: FuturesUnordered&#x3C;_> = data.into_iter()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(process_item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    futures.collect().await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"不要使用运行时专属的-io-类型\">不要使用运行时专属的 IO 类型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 耦合到 Tokio 的写法&#10;use tokio::net::TcpStream;&#10;&#10;pub async fn send_request(stream: &amp;mut TcpStream, req: Request) {&#10;    // ...&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 运行时无关的写法：使用 AsyncRead/AsyncWrite trait&#10;use futures::io::{AsyncRead, AsyncWrite};&#10;&#10;pub async fn send_request&lt;S: AsyncRead + AsyncWrite + Unpin&gt;(&#10;    stream: &amp;mut S,&#10;    req: Request,&#10;) {&#10;    // ...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 耦合到 Tokio 的写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::net::TcpStream;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn send_request(stream: &#x26;mut TcpStream, req: Request) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 运行时无关的写法：使用 AsyncRead/AsyncWrite trait</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::io::{AsyncRead, AsyncWrite};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn send_request&#x3C;S: AsyncRead + AsyncWrite + Unpin>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stream: &#x26;mut S,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    req: Request,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"不要使用运行时专属的时间-api\">不要使用运行时专属的时间 API</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 耦合到 Tokio 的写法&#10;use tokio::time::sleep;&#10;&#10;pub async fn retry_with_backoff(f: impl Fn() -&gt; impl Future&lt;Output = Result&lt;(), Error&gt;&gt;) {&#10;    for i in 0..3 {&#10;        if f().await.is_ok() { return; }&#10;        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(100 * (1 &lt;&lt; i))).await;&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 运行时无关的写法：接受 sleep 函数作为参数&#10;pub async fn retry_with_backoff&lt;Fut, SleepFut&gt;(&#10;    f: impl Fn() -&gt; Fut,&#10;    sleep: impl Fn(Duration) -&gt; SleepFut,&#10;) where&#10;    Fut: Future&lt;Output = Result&lt;(), Error&gt;&gt;,&#10;    SleepFut: Future&lt;Output = ()&gt;,&#10;{&#10;    for i in 0..3 {&#10;        if f().await.is_ok() { return; }&#10;        sleep(Duration::from_millis(100 * (1 &lt;&lt; i))).await;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 耦合到 Tokio 的写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio::time::sleep;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn retry_with_backoff(f: impl Fn() -> impl Future&#x3C;Output = Result&#x3C;(), Error>>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..3 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if f().await.is_ok() { return; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokio::time::sleep(Duration::from_millis(100 * (1 &#x3C;&#x3C; i))).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 运行时无关的写法：接受 sleep 函数作为参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub async fn retry_with_backoff&#x3C;Fut, SleepFut>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    f: impl Fn() -> Fut,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sleep: impl Fn(Duration) -> SleepFut,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Fut: Future&#x3C;Output = Result&#x3C;(), Error>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    SleepFut: Future&#x3C;Output = ()>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..3 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if f().await.is_ok() { return; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sleep(Duration::from_millis(100 * (1 &#x3C;&#x3C; i))).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"futures-crate-运行时无关的基础设施\">futures crate：运行时无关的基础设施</h2><p><code>futures</code> crate 是 Rust 异步生态的公共基础，提供了运行时无关的 trait、类型和工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// futures 提供的核心 trait&#10;use futures::{&#10;    Future,            // 异步计算&#10;    Stream,            // 异步值序列&#10;    Sink,              // 异步写入接收器&#10;    AsyncRead,         // 异步读取&#10;    AsyncWrite,        // 异步写入&#10;    AsyncBufRead,      // 带缓冲的异步读取&#10;    AsyncSeek,         // 异步定位&#10;};&#10;&#10;// futures 提供的实用工具&#10;use futures::{&#10;    future::{self, FutureExt, TryFutureExt},  // Future 组合器&#10;    stream::{self, StreamExt, TryStreamExt},   // Stream 组合器&#10;    channel::{mpsc, oneshot},                   // 运行时无关的 channel&#10;    executor::{self, block_on, LocalPool},      // 轻量级执行器（测试用）&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// futures 提供的核心 trait</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Future,            // 异步计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Stream,            // 异步值序列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Sink,              // 异步写入接收器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncRead,         // 异步读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncWrite,        // 异步写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncBufRead,      // 带缓冲的异步读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    AsyncSeek,         // 异步定位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// futures 提供的实用工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    future::{self, FutureExt, TryFutureExt},  // Future 组合器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stream::{self, StreamExt, TryStreamExt},   // Stream 组合器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    channel::{mpsc, oneshot},                   // 运行时无关的 channel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    executor::{self, block_on, LocalPool},      // 轻量级执行器（测试用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>futures::executor::block_on</code> 是一个简单的单线程执行器，常用于测试运行时无关的代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn test_my_future() {&#10;    futures::executor::block_on(async {&#10;        // 测试运行时无关的代码，不需要 Tokio&#10;        let result = my_async_function().await;&#10;        assert_eq!(result, expected);&#10;    });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn test_my_future() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    futures::executor::block_on(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 测试运行时无关的代码，不需要 Tokio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let result = my_async_function().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assert_eq!(result, expected);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"运行时特性门控-feature-flags\">运行时特性门控（Feature Flags）</h2><p>流行的运行时无关库（如 <code>reqwest</code>、<code>sqlx</code>）通过 Cargo feature flags 支持多运行时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml 中的 feature 定义&#10;[features]&#10;default = [&quot;tokio&quot;]&#10;tokio = [&quot;dep:tokio&quot;, &quot;tokio/net&quot;, &quot;tokio/io-util&quot;]&#10;async-std = [&quot;dep:async-std&quot;]&#10;smol = [&quot;dep:smol&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml 中的 feature 定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[features]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default = [\"tokio\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokio = [\"dep:tokio\", \"tokio/net\", \"tokio/io-util\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async-std = [\"dep:async-std\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>smol = [\"dep:smol\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 代码中的运行时检测&#10;#[cfg(feature = &quot;tokio&quot;)]&#10;async fn spawn_background&lt;F: Future&lt;Output = ()&gt; + Send + &#39;static&gt;(f: F) {&#10;    tokio::spawn(f);&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[cfg(feature = &quot;async-std&quot;)]&#10;async fn spawn_background&lt;F: Future&lt;Output = ()&gt; + Send + &#39;static&gt;(f: F) {&#10;    async_std::task::spawn(f);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 代码中的运行时检测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(feature = \"tokio\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn spawn_background&#x3C;F: Future&#x3C;Output = ()> + Send + 'static>(f: F) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tokio::spawn(f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(feature = \"async-std\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn spawn_background&#x3C;F: Future&#x3C;Output = ()> + Send + 'static>(f: F) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async_std::task::spawn(f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用者只需在 <code>Cargo.toml</code> 中选择对应 feature：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[dependencies]&#10;my-library = { version = &quot;1.0&quot;, features = [&quot;tokio&quot;] }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>my-library = { version = \"1.0\", features = [\"tokio\"] }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"tokio-util-tokio-与标准-future-trait-的桥接\">tokio-util：Tokio 与标准 Future trait 的桥接</h2><p><code>tokio-util</code> crate 提供了将 Tokio 类型转换为通用 trait 实现的工具，以及反向转换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio_util::io::{ReaderStream, StreamReader};&#10;use futures::io::AsyncRead;&#10;&#10;// 将 tokio::io::AsyncRead 转换为 futures::Stream&lt;Item = Bytes&gt;&#10;let stream = ReaderStream::new(tokio_file);&#10;&#10;// 将 futures::Stream&lt;Item = Bytes&gt; 转换为 tokio::io::AsyncRead&#10;let reader = StreamReader::new(bytes_stream);&#10;&#10;// 将 tokio::io::AsyncRead 转换为 futures::io::AsyncRead&#10;use tokio_util::compat::TokioAsyncReadCompatExt;&#10;let futures_reader = tokio_file.compat();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio_util::io::{ReaderStream, StreamReader};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::io::AsyncRead;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 将 tokio::io::AsyncRead 转换为 futures::Stream&#x3C;Item = Bytes></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let stream = ReaderStream::new(tokio_file);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 将 futures::Stream&#x3C;Item = Bytes> 转换为 tokio::io::AsyncRead</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let reader = StreamReader::new(bytes_stream);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 将 tokio::io::AsyncRead 转换为 futures::io::AsyncRead</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio_util::compat::TokioAsyncReadCompatExt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let futures_reader = tokio_file.compat();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这些转换工具使得基于不同 IO trait 体系编写的库可以互操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运行时无关的状态机与-reactor-抽象\">运行时无关的状态机与 Reactor 抽象</h2><p>对于高级场景（如实现自己的协议库），可以使用 <code>mio</code> 直接注册 IO 兴趣，通过回调而非运行时 spawn：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use mio::{Poll, Events, Token, Interest};&#10;use std::collections::HashMap;&#10;&#10;struct ProtoState {&#10;    connections: HashMap&lt;Token, ConnectionState&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl ProtoState {&#10;    fn drive(&amp;mut self, poll: &amp;mut Poll) {&#10;        let mut events = Events::with_capacity(128);&#10;        poll.poll(&amp;mut events, Some(Duration::from_millis(10))).unwrap();&#10;&#10;        for event in &amp;events {&#10;            match self.connections.get_mut(&amp;event.token()) {&#10;                Some(conn) =&gt; conn.handle_event(event),&#10;                None =&gt; {}&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use mio::{Poll, Events, Token, Interest};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::collections::HashMap;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ProtoState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    connections: HashMap&#x3C;Token, ConnectionState>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl ProtoState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn drive(&#x26;mut self, poll: &#x26;mut Poll) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut events = Events::with_capacity(128);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        poll.poll(&#x26;mut events, Some(Duration::from_millis(10))).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for event in &#x26;events {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            match self.connections.get_mut(&#x26;event.token()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Some(conn) => conn.handle_event(event),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                None => {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种方法完全不依赖异步运行时，可以嵌入任何环境（包括没有异步运行时的同步程序）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试运行时无关代码的最佳实践\">测试运行时无关代码的最佳实践</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(test)]&#10;mod tests {&#10;    use super::*;&#10;&#10;    // 方式 1：使用 futures::executor::block_on（最简单）&#10;    #[test]&#10;    fn test_with_futures_executor() {&#10;        futures::executor::block_on(async {&#10;            let result = my_runtime_agnostic_fn().await;&#10;            assert_eq!(result, 42);&#10;        });&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 方式 2：使用 tokio::test（项目已依赖 Tokio 时）&#10;    #[tokio::test]&#10;    async fn test_with_tokio() {&#10;        let result = my_runtime_agnostic_fn().await;&#10;        assert_eq!(result, 42);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 方式 3：使用 async-std 的测试宏&#10;    #[async_std::test]&#10;    async fn test_with_async_std() {&#10;        let result = my_runtime_agnostic_fn().await;&#10;        assert_eq!(result, 42);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(test)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mod tests {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    use super::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 1：使用 futures::executor::block_on（最简单）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn test_with_futures_executor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        futures::executor::block_on(async {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let result = my_runtime_agnostic_fn().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            assert_eq!(result, 42);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 2：使用 tokio::test（项目已依赖 Tokio 时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[tokio::test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn test_with_tokio() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let result = my_runtime_agnostic_fn().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assert_eq!(result, 42);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 方式 3：使用 async-std 的测试宏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[async_std::test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn test_with_async_std() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let result = my_runtime_agnostic_fn().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assert_eq!(result, 42);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p>参见本章节：<a href=\"pin-and-self-referential\">Pin 与自引用结构</a> — 运行时无关的 Future 实现需要正确处理 Pin；<a href=\"async-ecosystem\">异步生态系统</a> — 各运行时的适用场景和生态支持。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>运行时无关设计的核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>使用标准 trait</strong>：优先 <code>futures::AsyncRead</code>/<code>AsyncWrite</code>/<code>Stream</code>，而非 <code>tokio::io::AsyncRead</code> 等运行时专属类型</li>\n<li><strong>feature 门控</strong>：通过 Cargo <code>[features]</code> 让用户选择运行时，每个运行时对应一个 feature flag</li>\n<li><strong>依赖注入</strong>：需要 spawn/sleep 时将其作为函数参数传入，而非直接调用运行时 API</li>\n<li><strong>测试隔离</strong>：使用 <code>futures::executor::block_on</code> 测试运行时无关代码，确保测试本身不依赖特定运行时</li>\n<li><strong>tokio-util 桥接</strong>：当需要连接 Tokio 专属类型和通用 futures trait 时，使用 <code>TokioAsyncReadCompatExt</code> 等桥接工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运行时无关设计：编写可移植的异步库","id":"运行时无关设计-编写可移植的异步库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时无关设计的层次","id":"运行时无关设计的层次"},{"level":2,"text":"避免运行时耦合的实践","id":"避免运行时耦合的实践"},{"level":3,"text":"不要直接 spawn","id":"不要直接-spawn"},{"level":3,"text":"不要使用运行时专属的 IO 类型","id":"不要使用运行时专属的-io-类型"},{"level":3,"text":"不要使用运行时专属的时间 API","id":"不要使用运行时专属的时间-api"},{"level":2,"text":"futures crate：运行时无关的基础设施","id":"futures-crate-运行时无关的基础设施"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时特性门控（Feature Flags）","id":"运行时特性门控-feature-flags"},{"level":2,"text":"tokio-util：Tokio 与标准 Future trait 的桥接","id":"tokio-util-tokio-与标准-future-trait-的桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时无关的状态机与 Reactor 抽象","id":"运行时无关的状态机与-reactor-抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"测试运行时无关代码的最佳实践","id":"测试运行时无关代码的最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Pin 与自引用结构：固定内存位置的安全保证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/advanced/pin-and-self-referential"},"next":{"title":"异步生态系统：Rust 异步编程的工具全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/advanced/async-ecosystem"}}